#! nimbus: desktop-recommends
# =============================================================================
# 75-storage-optional.list.chroot - scheduled parity (recommended)
# =============================================================================
# What: SnapRAID, which the "Pooled + parity" storage mode uses.
# Why:  spec Tab C. The Control Center hides "Pooled + parity" when SnapRAID
#       is missing (docs/PLAN.md NOTE-26), so a user without parity disks may
#       remove it without losing nimbusos-desktop (NOTE-48).
# Format rules: see 10-base.list.chroot.
# =============================================================================

snapraid
